---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="Home">
  <h1>Stardust DS</h1>
  <p class="lede">A universal, self-describing dictionary system, built to hold every word a body needs, for every project that grows out from it.</p>

  <h2>What it is</h2>
  <ul class="outline">
    <li>Started as one dictionary.</li>
    <li>Becoming the infrastructure underneath all of them: Stardust, Urban Wolf, Evolve, and whatever comes after.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Why it matters</h2>
  <ul class="outline">
    <li>Software this foundational, done right, doesn't stay small.</li>
    <li>We think it's a billion-dollar idea.</li>
    <li>We're building it in the open, with a small team now that's meant to grow.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Who we're looking for</h2>
  <ul class="outline">
    <li>Technologists</li>
    <li>Dictionary and content people</li>
    <li>Designers</li>
    <li>Marketers</li>
    <li>Legal help</li>
    <li>Anyone else who sees the shape of this and wants to help build it</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="track-list">
    <div class="track">
      <h2><a href="/structure">Structure →</a></h2>
      <p>See the divisions, the roles, who's already on the team, and what's still open.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="track">
      <h2><a href="/join">Join →</a></h2>
      <p>How to sign up, what founding-contributor commitment means, and what you'd be walking into.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
